1
00:00:00,834 --> 00:00:02,244
(All:)Hey!

2
00:00:05,239 --> 00:00:08,309
(Stuart:)What are you guys still doing here?
I got this, go. Go home.

3
00:00:10,077 --> 00:00:11,887
(Howard:)You sure?

4
00:00:13,180 --> 00:00:16,060
(Stuart:)Yeah, she's fed, she took her pills,
she's all tucked in and watching TV.

5
00:00:16,650 --> 00:00:18,190
(Bernadette:)So, she's not too much for you?

6
00:00:18,352 --> 00:00:21,162
(Stuart:)Are you kidding?
I love her, she's great.

7
00:00:22,823 --> 00:00:25,323
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Stewie, you gonna watch
Wheel of Fortune with me?

8
00:00:25,492 --> 00:00:27,442
(Stuart:)Coming, Debbie.

9
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:32,210
(Howard:)-You call her Debbie?
-She insisted.

10
00:00:32,333 --> 00:00:34,833
(Stuart:)So, hey, guys, thank you so much.

11
00:00:35,002 --> 00:00:36,842
(Stuart:)This job is a dream come true.

12
00:00:43,577 --> 00:00:45,457
(Howard:)Was that a little weird?

13
00:00:45,613 --> 00:00:46,753
(Howard:)Yeah.

14
00:00:46,914 --> 00:00:50,364
(Bernadette:)I don't know why,
but something about it feels...

15
00:00:50,517 --> 00:00:52,117
(Bernadette:)...unnatural.

16
00:00:54,621 --> 00:00:56,291
(Howard:)-Okay, let's go.
-Yep.

17
00:00:58,959 --> 00:01:00,959
(Amy(on phone):)Okay, Sheldon,
thanks for checking in.

18
00:01:01,128 --> 00:01:03,078
(Amy(on phone):)Talk to you tomorrow?

19
00:01:03,230 --> 00:01:04,730
(Amy(on phone):)Okay, bye.

20
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:07,299
(Leonard:)He's okay?

21
00:01:07,468 --> 00:01:09,248
(Amy:)Actually sounds like
he's doing pretty well.

22
00:01:09,403 --> 00:01:11,613
(Penny:)I really think
this is gonna be for the best.

23
00:01:11,772 --> 00:01:15,122
(Leonard:)Me too. And he was able
to take a sabbatical from--

24
00:01:15,275 --> 00:01:17,655
How could you let him go!

